## 8. GENOME SEQUENCE SEARCH

- Start/End may be coordinates or DNA (A/T/G/C). `GenomeResult.php` `findSequenceMatches()` searches `fastas/reference.fasta` (1-based). Substring searches include hits that are part of longer matches.
- Flow: `GenomeSearch.php` → `GenomeResult.php?Start=ACGAACTTATG` → resolve sequence, optional “Sequence Search Results”, then gene/repeat queries using first match.

When asked to run, debug, or add a feature: locate entry points and data flow first, then make minimal changes.
